# ============================================================
# LoxxKing API - Manual Test Requests
# ============================================================
# Instructions: Replace placeholders (invoice-id, etc.) with actual IDs
# from your database before running these requests.
# ============================================================

### 1. Test Redis Caching - Categories (should be faster on 2nd call)
# First call - loads from database, caches in Redis
GET http://localhost:5160/api/categories
# Second call - should be noticeably faster (reads from Redis cache)

### 2. Test Redis Caching - Products (list with pagination)
# First call - loads from database
GET http://localhost:5160/api/products?page=1&pageSize=5
# Second call - should be faster (Redis cache)

### 3. Test Redis Caching - Active Offers
# First call - loads from database
GET http://localhost:5160/api/offers?activeOnly=true
# Second call - should be faster (Redis cache, 5-min TTL)

### 4. Test Redis Connection
# Before testing caching, ensure Redis is running:
# Run in terminal: redis-cli ping
# Should return: PONG

### 5. Test QuestPDF - Generate Invoice PDF
# Replace {invoice-id} with a valid invoice GUID from your database
GET http://localhost:5160/api/invoices/{invoice-id}/pdf
# Should return a PDF file download

### 6. Test SiteVisits - Create visit (public, no auth)
POST http://localhost:5160/api/site-visits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "countryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "page": "/home"
}

### 7. Test SiteVisits - Today count (requires auth)
# Replace {token} with a valid JWT token (Admin/StoreManager/SalesEmployee)
GET http://localhost:5160/api/site-visits/today-count
Authorization: Bearer {token}

### 8. Test SiteVisits - Paginated list (requires auth)
GET http://localhost:5160/api/site-visits?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {token}

### 9. Test SiteVisits - Filtered list (requires auth)
GET http://localhost:5160/api/site-visits?countryId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&dateFrom=2026-07-01&dateTo=2026-07-27
Authorization: Bearer {token}
